WEBVTT

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:10.440
<i>On a chaotic battlefield, the crew of 
Annex 1 fights for what they believe in.</i>

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:16.530
<i>Keiji was determined to never hit a woman,
no matter how strong she was</i>

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:21.410
<i>or how many fatal blows struck him.</i>

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:26.040
<i>He had a hidden goal as he endured the pain.</i>

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.420
<i>It was not to defeat his foe,</i>

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:33.550
<i>but to buy time for Wolf
 and the other operators</i>

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.990
<i>to reach the control room.</i>

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.590
If we successfully hack the tower,

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:52.670
we can restore communications with Earth

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:55.270
and tell them about No. 4 Division's betrayal.

00:00:55.270 --> 00:01:00.200
Then we'll all be able to go back to Earth...

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:08.150
...which is why we need to get rid 
of any obstacles in our way.

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:10.750
I'm going to where Liu is.

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:14.190
Once he knows that
 he's failed to capture you,

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:17.110
he'll fire a missile without hesitation.

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:25.270
I'll see you later!

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:28.640
I can't wait for our dinner back on Earth!

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:31.000
G-Great!

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.860
Let's all get dinner together!

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:41.290
First, let's get back to Earth alive.

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:43.790
Yeah. Everything else comes later.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:52.660
General,

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:54.810
aren't there too many of them?

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:58.480
If you see one, you need to 
assume there's a hundred.

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:00.220
That's how cockroaches are.

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:03.070
Once you know where the First and Second are,

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:05.290
fire the missile immediately.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:07.600
If we have to bring them 
back as corpses, that's fine.

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:11.920
So...

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:16.820
Don't get in my way!

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:20.780
Our goal is the First and 
the Second. That's all!

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.160
Ivan!

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:34.800
This is...

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:36.980
Yeah.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:43.650
Captain! They're coming from 
the direction of the Annex 1!

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:49.890
They ran away from the bacteria type 
 No. 4 Division has.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:45.300
<i>We can only work in the 
contaminated air of the ship</i>

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:48.200
<i>for about six more minutes...</i>

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.390
<i>I'll finish hacking in six minutes!</i>

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:31.990
He has to finish the hack in six minutes?

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:35.350
Normally that would be impossible.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.270
Yeah.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:39.210
It feels like it's the last 
night of summer vacation,

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:41.650
or the day before a report's due,
 and we're doing all our work at once.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:44.230
There's not nearly enough time!

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:48.010
The Soul of 
the Weakest

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:56.620
And I never do well at times like this.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.810
<i>That's how it's always been for me.</i>

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:01.670
<i>In college, at work...</i>

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.100
<i>I was always alone.</i>

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.150
Goodnight.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.400
Yeah, goodnight.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:26.240
Night.

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:59.180
It's bugging out now?

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.770
Today's the wedding!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:06.070
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.810
<i>I couldn't do it on my own.</i>

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.490
<i>So I ran.</i>

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:17.090
Wolf, you bastard!

00:07:17.090 --> 00:07:19.330
What the hell is this?

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:24.050
He submitted it without fixing the bug?

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:25.640
What was he thinking?

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:28.350
If you can't do a job, don't take it!

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:33.710
<i>After that, I got sick and quit my job.</i>

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:36.510
<i>And I had a falling out with
 my wife after the wedding.</i>

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:40.600
<i>In the end, we divorced, 
and I was left all alone.</i>

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:44.050
<b>I'm glad you're here, though, Wolf.</b>

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:57.400
<b>Things are going 50% faster 
than anticipated because of you.</b>

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.400
<b>Nice work.</b>

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:59.820
<b>As long as you're here, 
I think we can do this.</b>

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:02.820
<b>Whoever fired you was a moron.</b>

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:07.660
<i>No...</i>

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:09.890
<i>it's not just my strength.</i>

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:17.140
<i>It's because I'm not alone.</i>

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.460
It's because everyone is here.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:20.090
<b>It's because everyone is here...</b>

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:21.600
Wolf...

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.510
<i>We're a bunch of nerds, who had
the skills but could never fit in...</i>

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:33.450
<i>We were kicked off Earth and sent to Mars,</i>

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:36.540
<i>and even here our rankings are crap.</i>

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:39.790
<i>But...</i>

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:49.180
<i>Everyone...</i>

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:52.420
Okay, this is the climax.

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:53.900
<b>Okay, this is the climax!</b>

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:53.900
<b>Don't cry until the end!</b>

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:53.900
<b>You're talking about yourself, 
right?</b>

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:53.900
<b>WLF</b>

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:59.460
We're taking back the broadcast 
tower No. 4 Division hijacked

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:01.890
and bringing communications 
 with Earth back online!

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:05.530
If we can talk to the command HQ on Earth,

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:08.320
we might be able to get them to 
send a rescue ship here fast.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:11.710
And the No. 4 Branch Office might 
be put in a difficult enough position

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:15.110
that they order the battle to stop.

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:18.820
<i>I'll make this happen.</i>

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.780
<i>I'll make it...</i>

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.590
<i>in time...</i>

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.320
<i>Everyone!</i>

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:47.600
<i>I should still be able to move for
at least four more minutes.</i>

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.800
<i>I-I can't believe the poison's 
affecting me so quickly.</i>

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:01.060
<i>Did it get in through the wound?</i>

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:14.210
<i>Just...</i>

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:15.920
<b>It's behind us...
 A terraformar.</b>

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:23.140
Just a little more...

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.890
You only needed a little more.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:33.910
<i>A little more and the damage from the 
poison inside me would've reoccurred,</i>

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:36.000
<i>and I wouldn't have been able to move.</i>

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:39.530
<i>I would've been unable to fight,</i>

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.010
<i>and he would've succeeded in his objective.</i>

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.850
<i>Without ever hitting me.</i>

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:47.490
Damn it!

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:50.030
Wh-Where are you going, Xi-san?

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:51.040
Huh?

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:54.420
To find the rest of the No. 1 and No. 2 Division
members that snuck aboard the ship.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:57.590
Then finish him and go.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:00.350
I can't fight right now.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:14.540
<i>I-If we do it together, 
we can make it in time...</i>

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.320
<i>Please...</i>

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:20.180
<i>No, don't speak!</i>

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:25.040
There's no need to finish him.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:26.580
He's going to die soon.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:30.000
I hit him a bunch of times with my chi,
and it's going to kill him.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.330
What are you saying?

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:32.790
That's not like you.

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:35.950
He could be pretending to be defeated.

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:42.090
You don't honestly believe what he said
about not punching Hong-chan, do you?

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:52.730
<i>If we make a lot of noise now, 
No. 4 Division will hear us.</i>

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:53.740
<i>But...</i>

00:11:57.800 --> 00:11:58.920
You're right.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.070
You're exactly right.

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:15.580
No!

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.040
They're already inside?!

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:23.330
<i>Just a little more...</i>

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:25.020
<i>Just a little more!</i>

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:26.430
<i>I won't run anymore!</i>

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.260
<i>This time I'm going to finish it to the end!</i>

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:29.810
<i>So...</i>

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:42.000
Keiji!

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:58.750
Y-You bastards..!

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:10.970
<b>All-Purpose Danger Zone Rescue 
and Combat Armor Suit
Man in the Shell
Capable of protecting against both biological
 and chemical weapons, as well as 99.9% of radiation.
It is also bulletproof and 
capable of absorbing some impacts, 
depending on the type.
It was never anticipated that the
 terraformars would use it.</b>

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.020
You asshole...

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:18.990
<i>How can he be so strong?!</i>

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:20.770
Wolf!

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:22.320
Now!

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:24.740
Xi-san!

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:35.750
H-He stood back up!

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:38.370
After getting hit with one of my punches!

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:45.730
Hey!

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:47.500
Not only are you getting in my way,

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.670
you went after Hong, didn't you?

00:13:51.820 --> 00:13:53.000
I'll kill you!

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:56.770
Th-This is crazy!

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.440
We were so close!

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:02.240
We only have three minutes before 
our basic masks are overwhelmed!

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:04.520
We need to start hacking again,

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:05.810
or we won't make it in time!

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:09.550
<i>I need to stop them hacking no matter what,</i>

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:15.410
<i>but both the terraformar and 
Onizuka Keiji are in my way!</i>

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:20.670
<i>And he might attack Hong
if I take my eyes off him!</i>

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:22.570
<i>There's no time!</i>

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:27.720
<i>While I'm fighting one of them, 
the other will kill my comrades.</i>

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.130
<i>I need to decide now...</i>

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:32.220
<i>Who do I punch to save everyone?</i>

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:37.590
The situation's changed.

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:38.730
I'm protecting my friends.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:39.810
Brace for impact!

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:42.640
M.A.R.S. Ranking 8
Onizuka Keiji
US-Japan Joint No. 1 Division
Surgery Base: Mantis Shrimp

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:54.490
<i>What the hell?</i>

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.910
<i>He wasn't serious before?</i>

00:14:57.450 --> 00:14:58.830
Ryuichi! Ryuji!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.350
Right!

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:12.510
Hong!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.170
Wolf,

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.150
I'm sorry...

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:46.420
It's okay.

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:52.060
You picked the option that was
most likely to help us all survive.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:06.620
No...

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:07.320
It can't be...

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:44.290
<i>The honey badger, a creature that 
lives in the African Savannah.</i>

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:45.940
<i>The locals call it a Ratel.</i>

00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:50.730
<i>It's extremely short-tempered and 
will attack no matter the foe.</i>

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:53.050
<i>It fears nothing,</i>

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:55.490
<i>not a hyena or a human.</i>

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:57.480
<i>Not only is it resistant to poison,</i>

00:16:57.480 --> 00:17:00.660
<i>it's covered in an extremely 
thick coat of fur</i>

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:04.160
<i>capable of absorbing and 
distributing any impact.</i>

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:10.380
<i>Neither the claws of a lion
nor the quills of a porcupine</i>

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:14.870
<i>can defeat this strange, 
invincible beast: the Ratel.</i>

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.920
Hey, Onizuka Keiji.

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:21.450
Your punches are fast and strong,

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.430
but you don't transfer your power right.

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:26.230
I'd rather die than cooperate with you.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:29.420
But we don't have any time,

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:32.150
and we don't want the civilians killed.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:34.410
So there's only one thing we can do.

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:35.490
Right?

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:54.830
Just match my timing.

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:56.630
You hit as hard as you can.

00:17:57.290 --> 00:18:02.560
I'll send that power right 
into his internal organs.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.900
He's going after Hong after all!

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.760
The joints should be less defended.

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:16.740
Snap in half!

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:21.030
<i>He jumped to avoid his bones being broken!</i>

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:23.240
<i>Does he know martial arts?</i>

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:24.880
No, nice work.

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:26.280
You, too.

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:30.960
This spin is full of momentum
from your mantis shrimp punch!

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.100
<i>No luck...</i>

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:45.490
<i>Maybe I have to send my chi energy 
through the sub-esophageal ganglion...</i>

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:57.950
Hey, you.

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:12.010
Xi-san...

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.140
Xi Chun-Li.

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:28.470
Just call me Chun-Li.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:30.000
M.A.R.S. Ranking 99
China-Asia No 4 Division
Surgery Base: Paintop Cuttlefish

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:31.740
This next move will finish it, Onizuka Keiji!

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:35.390
Xi-san!

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:44.200
You can see me, right?

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:45.910
Good.

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:52.680
<i>This is the last hit!</i>

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:54.250
<i>We'll have to bet everything on this!</i>

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:56.210
<i>I'll match your timing,</i>

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:57.640
<i>so hit him!</i>

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:31.660
X-Xi-san...

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.590
K-Keiji...

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:36.350
Thank you.

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:37.910
But...

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:43.180
We failed to hack the tower.

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:48.280
I didn't make it in time again...

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:54.370
XO Michelle, Akari, and the others...

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:59.010
Captain Komachi, who bet everything on us...

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:01.820
And you, too, Keiji...

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:03.780
Forgive us.

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:08.520
You all gave us a chance, and we wasted it.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:13.790
Not yet!

00:21:27.330 --> 00:21:30.740
I won't let it go to waste, everyone.

00:21:34.210 --> 00:21:35.490
Amelia...

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:51.600
<i>You did a great job getting us this far, Wolf.</i>

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:57.420
<i>And Keiji, you fought so hard
 and were hurt so badly...</i>

00:21:58.760 --> 00:22:01.260
<i>I won't let your efforts go to waste!</i>

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:40.980
12 Second Revolution

00:23:37.550 --> 00:23:40.330
I won't let your efforts
 go to waste, everyone!
